WEBVTT

00:00:02.620 --> 00:00:08.770
Long ago, humans and monsters waged 
 a war that lasted a hundred years.

00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:14.350
Not a single soul remembered 
why the fighting had started.

00:00:15.460 --> 00:00:20.360
Their reason for fighting slowly faded as time 
passed, and then completely disappeared.

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:27.170
When both the monsters and the humans 
were too exhausted to go on any longer,

00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:29.020
the war came to an end.

00:00:30.180 --> 00:00:34.730
Eventually, humans and monsters 
began to interact with each other,

00:00:35.480 --> 00:00:36.620
and then...

00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:40.640
<b>Monster Girl Doctor</b>

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:46.900
My husband... But my husband is...

00:00:47.190 --> 00:00:50.610
I'm very sorry. Please try to 
bear with it just a little longer.

00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:53.500
Medical practice.

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:54.770
Bear with it.

00:00:54.770 --> 00:00:56.410
Okay...

00:00:59.820 --> 00:01:01.230
No lumps.

00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:03.280
Next, let's check your ears.

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:06.340
O-Okay...

00:01:07.240 --> 00:01:09.080
Heave-ho.

00:01:13.950 --> 00:01:15.070
Does that hurt?

00:01:15.070 --> 00:01:19.110
No, it's just... my ears 
are rather sensitive...

00:01:21.870 --> 00:01:24.220
I see. All right.

00:01:28.610 --> 00:01:30.740
Wipey, wipey. Zoom.

00:01:31.990 --> 00:01:36.240
Doctor, please... 
What kind of illness do I have?

00:01:41.730 --> 00:01:43.250
You're expecting.

00:01:44.740 --> 00:01:48.640
Sirsa, thank goodness! I'm so happy!

00:01:48.640 --> 00:01:50.490
Darling!

00:01:51.170 --> 00:01:56.130
Breast pain and red ears are signs 
of pregnancy unique to minotaurs.

00:01:58.980 --> 00:02:00.740
Congratulations.

00:02:00.740 --> 00:02:02.510
Thank you very much!

00:02:03.250 --> 00:02:05.440
The pain will eventually subside,

00:02:05.440 --> 00:02:08.190
but if it bothers you too much, 
you can take some pain meds.

00:02:08.630 --> 00:02:10.520
Saphentite, please get her some herbs.

00:02:10.840 --> 00:02:13.130
Of course, Dr. Glenn.

00:02:13.130 --> 00:02:14.130
Hmph.

00:02:15.440 --> 00:02:18.900
Case 1        The Centaur of the Arena

00:02:29.360 --> 00:02:30.870
Cleaning!

00:02:31.240 --> 00:02:32.750
Tidying!

00:02:33.140 --> 00:02:36.630
Excellent work today, Dr. Glenn.

00:02:37.170 --> 00:02:39.590
You, too, Saphentite.

00:02:41.080 --> 00:02:43.150
Hey, is something wrong?

00:02:43.560 --> 00:02:46.110
No, I'm quite all right.

00:02:46.110 --> 00:02:49.530
It's not like I'm bothered by 
you being all alone with

00:02:49.530 --> 00:02:53.140
a woman who just got married 
and making her moan.

00:02:53.930 --> 00:02:56.640
S-Sorry. I was concentrating on the exam.

00:02:56.640 --> 00:02:58.230
It's quite all right.

00:02:58.780 --> 00:03:01.580
The way you tune everything 
else out during exams

00:03:01.580 --> 00:03:04.270
is one of your finer qualities.

00:03:04.270 --> 00:03:07.530
That's not exactly the part 
I'm talking about, though...

00:03:08.050 --> 00:03:10.600
I'd rather you not call me "Saphentite,"

00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:13.530
but "Sapphee," like when we 
were attending the academy.

00:03:13.530 --> 00:03:16.530
Oh. Sorry about that, Sapphee.

00:03:16.530 --> 00:03:18.370
It's quite all right, Doctor.

00:03:24.040 --> 00:03:25.050
Yes?

00:03:26.900 --> 00:03:28.560
Special delivery!

00:03:28.890 --> 00:03:30.000
Thanks.

00:03:34.840 --> 00:03:38.570
From the Central Hospital... 
It's from Dr. Cthulhy.

00:03:46.950 --> 00:03:50.990
How can Dr. Cthulhy be so selfish?

00:03:51.420 --> 00:03:55.510
Lindworm's Central Hospital 
always needs a helping hand.

00:03:55.510 --> 00:03:58.160
And our clinic only has the two of us.

00:03:58.160 --> 00:04:03.320
You had to close it for the day just so 
you could do physicals at the arena.

00:04:03.320 --> 00:04:05.020
Curse that octopus woman.

00:04:05.400 --> 00:04:07.220
It's the least I can do to repay her.

00:04:07.220 --> 00:04:12.510
I was only able to open up my 
own clinic thanks to her backing.

00:04:12.510 --> 00:04:15.120
I can't argue with that, but...

00:04:15.120 --> 00:04:19.940
Besides, I'll be able to examine 
a lot of patients by doing physicals.

00:04:20.390 --> 00:04:25.400
Dr. Cthulhy organized this to help 
me gain even more experience.

00:04:25.870 --> 00:04:29.300
You are far too kind, Dr. Glenn.

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:33.860
I guess we can just leave it at that.

00:04:34.470 --> 00:04:39.410
The fighters we'll be seeing are mid-level 
fighters from the third and fourth ranks,

00:04:39.410 --> 00:04:42.390
so we might come upon a unique 
case we haven't seen before.

00:04:47.860 --> 00:04:49.550
Let me help you, Sapphee.

00:04:49.550 --> 00:04:51.820
Thank you, Doctor.

00:04:52.760 --> 00:04:55.830
There we go. 
I believe that's all of your luggage.

00:04:55.830 --> 00:04:57.650
Yes. Thank you very much.

00:04:58.360 --> 00:05:01.410
Doctor, when you're 
conducting the physicals today,

00:05:01.410 --> 00:05:04.690
please do what you can for our princess.

00:05:05.640 --> 00:05:07.200
Princess?

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:12.880
Welcome to the Great Lindworm Arena!

00:05:12.880 --> 00:05:14.240
A pleasure to meet you.

00:05:14.240 --> 00:05:20.330
I am one of the third-rank 
fighters here, Tisalia Scythia!

00:05:21.210 --> 00:05:24.850
I'm here to conduct physicals 
in Dr. Cthulhy's stead.

00:05:24.850 --> 00:05:26.360
I'm Glenn Litbeit.

00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:30.030
And I am his assistant, Saphentite Neikes.

00:05:30.880 --> 00:05:33.680
Wow, he really is a human doctor.

00:05:33.680 --> 00:05:36.300
I heard he was young, 
but he's even younger than I expected.

00:05:36.300 --> 00:05:38.650
Come on, doctor boy. 
Hurry up with the exams.

00:05:38.650 --> 00:05:41.120
You're being quite rude!

00:05:41.120 --> 00:05:44.660
He will be examining us in 
order, so calm yourselves.

00:05:44.660 --> 00:05:46.100
Yes, ma'am.

00:05:46.100 --> 00:05:47.980
Wow.

00:05:47.980 --> 00:05:51.530
Do you always direct them 
like this, Miss Tisalia?

00:05:51.780 --> 00:05:56.030
Indeed. After all, I'm sure 
you can see my credentials.

00:05:58.320 --> 00:06:00.000
Oh, deary me.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:03.000
I guess I can't blame you 
for losing your composure

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:05.420
over my beautiful body, 
which rivals that of a goddess.

00:06:05.680 --> 00:06:07.970
Oh, that wasn't my intention...

00:06:08.420 --> 00:06:11.430
But this is what I wanted you to admire.

00:06:12.010 --> 00:06:15.920
I am the sole heiress to the one 
and only Scythia Transportation,

00:06:15.920 --> 00:06:21.300
which dominates the transportation industry in 
this city. Our motto is "From parcels to people!"

00:06:21.690 --> 00:06:24.570
You may admire my greatness now.

00:06:32.040 --> 00:06:35.370
I see. That's what he meant by "princess."

00:06:37.460 --> 00:06:40.050
Owie!

00:06:40.280 --> 00:06:43.130
There's definitely some inflammation.

00:06:43.130 --> 00:06:45.940
You should probably avoid 
competing for a few days.

00:06:45.940 --> 00:06:46.500
Meow!

00:06:46.900 --> 00:06:49.520
That's not going to happen, Doctor.

00:06:49.520 --> 00:06:53.170
There's an important match this week 
with a chance for promotion on the line.

00:06:53.520 --> 00:06:56.190
I'm sure you can help me-owt, Doctor.

00:06:57.430 --> 00:06:59.000
A-All right.

00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:02.720
Then we'll immobilize it tightly. 
Just try not to push yourself too hard.

00:07:02.720 --> 00:07:04.980
That's great! Thanks, Doc—

00:07:04.980 --> 00:07:07.110
Right this way, please.

00:07:09.250 --> 00:07:11.080
Let's see... Next, we have...

00:07:11.420 --> 00:07:12.950
It is I!

00:07:20.760 --> 00:07:24.620
Do you fancy centaurs like myself, Doctor?

00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:26.400
Me-owch!

00:07:26.400 --> 00:07:27.870
Oh, I'm terribly sorry!

00:07:28.300 --> 00:07:31.450
I am the heiress to the 
Scythia Transportation.

00:07:31.450 --> 00:07:34.360
I will one day lead all 
the centaurs of Lindworm

00:07:34.360 --> 00:07:37.220
in securing the future of the company.

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:42.380
That being the case, I will first be 
expected to marry and bear a child.

00:07:42.900 --> 00:07:46.870
I am still searching for the perfect candidate,

00:07:46.870 --> 00:07:51.320
but despite having so many suitors,
I haven't been able to find the right one.

00:07:51.990 --> 00:07:57.250
We Scythia pride ourselves on our valor, 
but I am not fond of brutish men.

00:07:57.610 --> 00:08:00.250
If I had to choose, yes...

00:08:00.820 --> 00:08:07.100
I'd much prefer a young, intelligent doctor 
who spends his time treating monsters.

00:08:07.100 --> 00:08:09.040
Excuse me a moment.

00:08:09.590 --> 00:08:11.450
My, my, Miss Tisalia.

00:08:11.450 --> 00:08:14.780
It seems your waist measurement has 
grown significantly since last month.

00:08:14.780 --> 00:08:16.810
What do you think you're doing?

00:08:16.810 --> 00:08:19.270
Don't you dare measure me 
with that filthy tail of yours!

00:08:19.270 --> 00:08:21.800
Also, you should be measuring here.

00:08:21.800 --> 00:08:25.170
Honestly, you don't even know that? 
And you call yourself a nurse!

00:08:25.170 --> 00:08:27.630
I'm not a nurse. I am a doctor.

00:08:27.630 --> 00:08:29.350
That matters not!

00:08:30.700 --> 00:08:36.030
Here! Have a good, long look, 
snake woman, at my gorgeous waist.

00:08:36.440 --> 00:08:41.050
I'll have you know that Dr. Glenn is very 
much a fledgling when it comes to medicine.

00:08:41.450 --> 00:08:44.300
It'll be thirty years before he's ready 
to be a marriage candidate.

00:08:44.620 --> 00:08:49.670
What are you saying? The best 
marriages and racehorses are quick!

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:52.370
Oh, dear. Your measurements 
really have increased.

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:54.210
What?!

00:08:54.890 --> 00:08:58.050
Tisalia Scythia is perfectly healthy.

00:08:58.680 --> 00:09:01.020
<b>Monster Girl Doctor</b>

00:09:01.710 --> 00:09:04.510
We're finally finished, Dr. Glenn.

00:09:05.020 --> 00:09:07.950
Yes. I'm glad we finished 
while the sun is still up.

00:09:07.950 --> 00:09:10.470
It's all thanks to Miss Tisalia's 
stellar leadership.

00:09:11.740 --> 00:09:15.480
I wanted to say goodbye to her 
before heading home, but...

00:09:16.390 --> 00:09:18.770
Well, she's not here, 
so there's no need to bother.

00:09:18.770 --> 00:09:21.580
Why not just leave her 
a message with someone?

00:09:21.580 --> 00:09:23.540
I guess I could do that.

00:09:23.540 --> 00:09:25.510
Excuse me, Doctor.

00:09:25.510 --> 00:09:27.760
Do you have a moment?

00:09:29.720 --> 00:09:32.150
Oh, you're Miss Tisalia's...

00:09:32.150 --> 00:09:33.950
Yes, we are her attendants. I'm Kay.

00:09:33.950 --> 00:09:35.750
And I am Lorna.

00:09:36.860 --> 00:09:40.750
So... how did our lady's exam go?

00:09:41.140 --> 00:09:44.010
Is she afflicted by anything?

00:09:44.450 --> 00:09:46.680
Afflicted?

00:09:49.250 --> 00:09:53.100
No. Miss Tisalia Scythia is perfectly healthy.

00:09:53.100 --> 00:09:58.520
Probably due to the fact that she exercises 
regularly and practices temperance.

00:09:58.840 --> 00:10:02.800
Nothing seemed to indicate 
that she was sick.

00:10:02.800 --> 00:10:05.180
I see...

00:10:05.180 --> 00:10:07.280
Is there something worrying you?

00:10:08.520 --> 00:10:10.410
Miss Kay and Miss Lorna...

00:10:11.600 --> 00:10:15.320
I'm sure Miss Tisalia is very important to you.

00:10:15.320 --> 00:10:16.450
Y-Yes.

00:10:16.450 --> 00:10:17.800
But of course!

00:10:17.800 --> 00:10:20.460
In that case, please feel 
free to tell me anything.

00:10:20.460 --> 00:10:25.580
Then, if I can tell you as a doctor 
that everything is all right,

00:10:25.580 --> 00:10:27.540
it might put you at ease.

00:10:29.020 --> 00:10:31.060
Okay, we'll tell you.

00:10:31.060 --> 00:10:33.270
You see, our lady...

00:10:37.520 --> 00:10:39.600
I thought I'd find you here.

00:10:40.180 --> 00:10:41.570
Sapphee!

00:10:41.570 --> 00:10:44.360
You can go to bed. It's late.

00:10:44.360 --> 00:10:46.690
That should be my line.

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:51.550
I didn't see you in your 
bedroom, so I came here.

00:10:51.550 --> 00:10:54.170
Staying up too late is not 
good for your health.

00:10:54.170 --> 00:10:58.620
I'm pretty sure you've been telling 
me that ever since we were kids.

00:10:58.620 --> 00:11:03.320
Of course I have. 
Not only are we childhood friends,

00:11:03.320 --> 00:11:05.960
but I was your senior at the academy, too.

00:11:05.960 --> 00:11:07.930
I guess you know all about me, then.

00:11:07.930 --> 00:11:11.850
Indeed. You're thinking about what 
happened at the arena, aren't you?

00:11:12.530 --> 00:11:13.440
Yeah.

00:11:14.660 --> 00:11:19.300
You see, our lady hasn't been 
able to win any matches lately.

00:11:19.300 --> 00:11:22.070
You mean her matches at the arena?

00:11:22.420 --> 00:11:28.140
Yes. Until recently, she was 
among the highest of the third rank.

00:11:28.140 --> 00:11:31.220
But lately, her lack of victories 
is clearly getting to her,

00:11:31.870 --> 00:11:34.580
and we don't know what's causing it.

00:11:35.240 --> 00:11:40.480
Not only was our lady born into the prestigious 
Scythia family and naturally gifted...

00:11:40.480 --> 00:11:44.590
But she trains and works hard every single day.

00:11:44.590 --> 00:11:46.940
And yet, she's having difficulty winning...

00:11:47.330 --> 00:11:50.670
So we thought she might 
be afflicted with something.

00:11:51.530 --> 00:11:56.460
They contacted me earlier 
saying that she lost again tonight.

00:11:56.460 --> 00:11:59.580
Apparently, she hasn't won 
a single match this month.

00:11:59.580 --> 00:12:04.360
That's very hard to imagine, 
considering how she presented herself.

00:12:04.920 --> 00:12:07.510
I'm sure it has to do with her pride.

00:12:07.510 --> 00:12:10.360
She doesn't want to be the one 
to bring her problems to light.

00:12:11.240 --> 00:12:13.980
Everyone has their good and bad days.

00:12:14.510 --> 00:12:16.590
It may have nothing to do with an illness.

00:12:16.990 --> 00:12:19.100
And if that's the case, great.

00:12:23.130 --> 00:12:25.840
But I'm worried that it isn't.

00:12:30.080 --> 00:12:33.240
Why don't we have something 
to drink, Doctor?

00:12:33.240 --> 00:12:35.280
Huh? You mean alcohol?

00:12:35.280 --> 00:12:37.850
Yes. I'll get you a glass right away.

00:12:43.520 --> 00:12:47.280
<i>I didn't notice any symptoms in 
Miss Tisalia that would suggest she's ill.</i>

00:12:47.950 --> 00:12:51.790
<i>The same could be said of 
Dr. Cthulhy's previous exams.</i>

00:12:52.380 --> 00:12:58.550
<i>Could her condition be something 
that a doctor wouldn't notice?</i>

00:12:59.130 --> 00:13:03.310
<i>Something not written on her chart, 
that we wouldn't consider worth noting...</i>

00:13:04.750 --> 00:13:06.490
Here you are.

00:13:10.180 --> 00:13:12.550
S-Sapphee, you used ice?

00:13:12.550 --> 00:13:14.900
Isn't this ice meant to be 
used for antipyretic purposes?

00:13:14.900 --> 00:13:16.690
I only used a little.

00:13:16.690 --> 00:13:20.360
And if we run out, I'll just fetch 
more from the Vivre Mountains.

00:13:20.360 --> 00:13:23.130
But going all the way to the summit 
and back is a two-day trip!

00:13:23.130 --> 00:13:25.730
Please don't get too mad about 
trivial matters like this.

00:13:25.730 --> 00:13:27.560
It's not a very stiff drink,

00:13:27.560 --> 00:13:32.060
but the medicinal effects of the herbs 
and the ice should make you feel better.

00:13:33.120 --> 00:13:34.470
Enjoy.

00:13:39.870 --> 00:13:42.070
It's delicious. Thank you.

00:13:42.070 --> 00:13:44.170
Wait, what are you drinking, Sapphee?

00:13:47.450 --> 00:13:51.160
That reeks of alcohol! 
Wait, is that Firedragon Whiskey?

00:13:51.630 --> 00:13:56.690
Why, yes. It was a gift for 
completing the physicals

00:13:56.690 --> 00:13:58.570
from Miss Kay and Miss Lorna.

00:13:58.570 --> 00:14:02.850
When did they... That's extremely potent.

00:14:03.920 --> 00:14:09.500
More importantly, did you figure out 
why Miss Tisalia's not performing well?

00:14:09.500 --> 00:14:14.450
I can't say for certain, but I'm 
pretty sure she isn't sick.

00:14:14.890 --> 00:14:16.010
Then what is it?

00:14:16.430 --> 00:14:19.150
There's something a doctor can do 
even if their patient isn't sick.

00:14:25.160 --> 00:14:28.290
There's somewhere I want to go tomorrow.

00:14:28.290 --> 00:14:31.930
If possible, I also want to go to 
the arena and see Miss Tisalia.

00:14:32.400 --> 00:14:35.090
Saphentite, will you come with me?

00:14:35.090 --> 00:14:38.940
You want me to come with 
you to see another girl?

00:14:38.940 --> 00:14:41.790
What are you thinking?

00:14:41.790 --> 00:14:43.780
That's not what I mean.

00:14:43.780 --> 00:14:45.660
I won't allow you to go.

00:14:45.660 --> 00:14:49.850
I don't want that woman courting you again.

00:14:49.850 --> 00:14:52.310
B-But, Saphentite—

00:14:52.310 --> 00:14:57.390
That horse princess's amorous approach 
went to your head, didn't it?

00:14:57.390 --> 00:14:59.300
It's not fair, Doctor!

00:14:59.620 --> 00:15:05.290
Doctor Cthulhy said she'd never forgive 
me if I ever laid a finger on you!

00:15:05.290 --> 00:15:08.130
Y-You know... This is a lot tighter than usu—

00:15:08.130 --> 00:15:11.700
I absolutely will not tolerate 
any more rivals appearing!

00:15:11.700 --> 00:15:13.050
Do you hear me?!

00:15:13.050 --> 00:15:15.830
I'm just going to treat her!

00:15:15.830 --> 00:15:19.410
I don't trust you!

00:15:20.020 --> 00:15:21.450
Listen, Sapphee.

00:15:21.810 --> 00:15:23.530
Yes, Doctor?

00:15:23.530 --> 00:15:27.920
I need your help. I'd like to leave after 
our afternoon appointments tomorrow.

00:15:28.360 --> 00:15:30.020
You'll help me, won't you?

00:15:30.020 --> 00:15:33.530
But of course! I'd follow you 
to the ends of the earth.

00:15:40.490 --> 00:15:41.890
Don't drink too much.

00:15:43.760 --> 00:15:44.710
I won't.

00:15:57.590 --> 00:16:01.410
The match is over! The winner is Elis Malea!

00:16:09.690 --> 00:16:12.000
So that's ten losses in a row for Tisalia.

00:16:12.000 --> 00:16:13.830
Yeah, that's rough.

00:16:14.210 --> 00:16:16.310
Maybe the prestigious Scythia 
family's lost their touch

00:16:16.310 --> 00:16:18.820
after concentrating too much 
on their transportation gig.

00:16:19.220 --> 00:16:25.210
<i>I became a fighter in order to uphold the 
glory and honor of the Scythia family...</i>

00:16:25.970 --> 00:16:29.150
<i>There's nothing wrong with me physically, 
and yet, something isn't right.</i>

00:16:29.700 --> 00:16:31.020
<i>What could it be?</i>

00:16:36.140 --> 00:16:39.260
<i>I... I need to train harder.</i>

00:16:39.260 --> 00:16:41.770
<i>I need to remember how 
I felt when things went well!</i>

00:16:58.170 --> 00:16:59.600
Doctor?

00:17:00.090 --> 00:17:01.570
You two...

00:17:02.450 --> 00:17:04.340
I'm sorry for interrupting.

00:17:04.340 --> 00:17:06.430
They were worried about you,

00:17:06.430 --> 00:17:09.650
so I came here to tell you why you 
aren't performing at your best lately.

00:17:11.680 --> 00:17:14.140
We're terribly sorry, my lady.

00:17:14.140 --> 00:17:16.710
We realize we were meddling, but...

00:17:16.710 --> 00:17:21.230
Nay. I am blessed to have 
such wonderful attendants.

00:17:21.790 --> 00:17:25.740
So, Doctor, what's the reason 
behind my recent slump?

00:17:25.740 --> 00:17:28.640
It's... your hooves.

00:17:30.120 --> 00:17:32.770
I should've realized it sooner.

00:17:32.770 --> 00:17:37.480
Your chart made no mention 
of them being shod.

00:17:37.870 --> 00:17:40.030
No matter how much you train,

00:17:40.030 --> 00:17:43.110
walking around on dirt won't wear 
down your hooves very much.

00:17:43.110 --> 00:17:47.500
The other centaur fighters, 
including Miss Kay and Miss Lorna,

00:17:47.500 --> 00:17:49.090
all wear horseshoes.

00:17:50.190 --> 00:17:54.880
Currently, your legs aren't balanced.

00:17:55.270 --> 00:17:58.760
Let's trim your hooves and 
get you some horseshoes.

00:18:01.040 --> 00:18:04.270
No, that's quite all right.

00:18:05.010 --> 00:18:07.570
I am the princess of Scythia family.

00:18:07.570 --> 00:18:10.710
My body is a precious temple, 
handed down to me by my ancestors.

00:18:10.710 --> 00:18:14.650
I will not allow anyone to desecrate 
any part of it, including my hooves—

00:18:15.920 --> 00:18:17.230
What are you—

00:18:17.230 --> 00:18:19.770
We do apologize for this, my lady.

00:18:19.770 --> 00:18:22.900
But we've already paid for 
your trimming and fitting.

00:18:22.900 --> 00:18:25.240
Wh-What?!

00:18:34.650 --> 00:18:37.270
Now, let's get started, Miss Tisalia.

00:18:41.750 --> 00:18:43.130
N-No!

00:18:43.130 --> 00:18:45.760
I don't like pain! I'm scared!

00:18:45.760 --> 00:18:49.260
Unhand me at once, you two! 
I don't want this!

00:18:49.260 --> 00:18:50.760
My lady!

00:18:50.760 --> 00:18:53.140
Please stop acting like a child.

00:18:53.420 --> 00:18:56.800
It'll be over before you know it. 
Don't worry, it won't hurt.

00:18:58.240 --> 00:19:02.470
H-How dare you sneak between 
a lady's legs like this, you lecher?

00:19:02.470 --> 00:19:05.040
I'll never be able to marry now.

00:19:05.040 --> 00:19:08.030
Sure, you will. We're just taking 
some necessary measures.

00:19:09.910 --> 00:19:14.050
<i>Miss Tisalia's special move is to dash 
as fast as she can, then strike.</i>

00:19:14.730 --> 00:19:16.710
<i>Since her front legs carry more weight,</i>

00:19:16.710 --> 00:19:19.060
<i>the hooves on her hind legs 
have grown too long.</i>

00:19:20.550 --> 00:19:24.190
U-Um, kind Doctor, 
that area is quite sensitive,

00:19:24.190 --> 00:19:26.890
so please... please do be gentle.

00:19:27.430 --> 00:19:29.810
It's all right. You have 
nothing to worry about.

00:19:34.490 --> 00:19:37.530
You mustn't... Not there...

00:19:47.670 --> 00:19:49.450
Boss, we need the horseshoe.

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:50.850
You got it.

00:19:56.950 --> 00:19:59.420
There's no way that thing isn't hot!

00:19:59.420 --> 00:20:02.180
I cannot do this! 
You're going to burn my foot!

00:20:02.180 --> 00:20:06.260
Unhand me at once, you two! Unhand me!

00:20:02.520 --> 00:20:04.410
You'll be fine, my lady!

00:20:04.970 --> 00:20:07.920
You're going to accidentally 
kick the kind doctor.

00:20:06.260 --> 00:20:08.840
No! I don't want this!

00:20:20.750 --> 00:20:22.590
Memé, fetch me the nails, please.

00:20:23.360 --> 00:20:25.240
Nails?

00:20:25.240 --> 00:20:28.730
Absolutely not! I will not allow you 
to put h-h-holes in my feet!

00:20:28.730 --> 00:20:30.360
You won't have holes in your feet.

00:20:30.360 --> 00:20:33.120
Please, no! I-I don't want this! N-No nails!

00:20:30.750 --> 00:20:33.120
Please calm down, my lady.

00:20:33.120 --> 00:20:36.490
I-I can't!

00:20:35.270 --> 00:20:39.260
Please pipe down, Miss Tisalia.

00:20:41.490 --> 00:20:44.200
We need a little quiet time.

00:21:01.770 --> 00:21:05.630
I-I... I can't...

00:21:06.290 --> 00:21:09.580
No more!

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:17.050
She truly is the princess of Scythia.

00:21:17.590 --> 00:21:21.140
She was kind enough to get 
us such excellent seats.

00:21:21.140 --> 00:21:22.040
Yeah.

00:21:22.040 --> 00:21:25.510
She's on a three-win streak 
after her ten losses.

00:21:25.510 --> 00:21:27.640
Looks like the shoes are working for her.

00:21:37.480 --> 00:21:41.030
Dr. Cthulhy must be losing her touch.

00:21:41.030 --> 00:21:45.850
I can't believe that octopus woman didn't 
even think to look at her hooves first.

00:21:45.850 --> 00:21:48.500
Well, Dr. Cthulhy tries to 
honor her patients' wishes,

00:21:48.500 --> 00:21:51.990
so she won't do anything unless they 
or the people around them ask.

00:21:53.400 --> 00:21:58.250
She might've actually been testing us.

00:21:59.730 --> 00:22:02.140
How troublesome.

00:22:25.480 --> 00:22:31.360
Sapphee, I think this means we can 
be a bit more persistent as doctors.

00:22:31.760 --> 00:22:34.600
We don't have to just follow 
in Dr. Cthulhy's footsteps.

00:22:34.600 --> 00:22:37.880
We can do things our way. Okay?

00:22:38.300 --> 00:22:40.320
Of course, Dr. Glenn.

00:22:42.040 --> 00:22:46.310
Doctor! Doctor!

00:22:51.910 --> 00:22:52.940
Doctor...

00:22:53.570 --> 00:22:58.270
You aren't actually serious 
about courting her, are you?

00:22:58.270 --> 00:22:59.940
N-No! I wouldn't dream of it!

00:22:59.940 --> 00:23:04.440
I won, Doctor!

00:23:31.520 --> 00:23:33.660
Who are you?

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.010
Case 2         The Mermaid of the Waterways

00:23:35.880 --> 00:23:39.620
Case 2: "The Mermaid of the Waterways."
